[{"client_msg_id":"59638b80-7135-4560-ae6d-ed3c80f21b28","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"言語として標準でつかえるいくつかは暗黙でimortされてる状態になるだろうけど...","ts":"1636593610.323700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kqmB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa73dc62-0668-4d35-9473-76a15af77b50","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"`dataclass` もそのままで参照できてるし `from dataclasses import *` してる前提ぽい","ts":"1636593468.323100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CtoaR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bbdbfe0-f8dd-442c-9d11-354e2069ed4e","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あーなるほど。やはりそうですよね。 `import` 文が省略されてたのか。。","ts":"1636593413.322100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gzL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aca50261-ab1b-4923-bbc8-0a13e19e4a2a","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"型アノテーションとして記述するの気持わるい……。でもどうせやるなら `KW_ONLY[field2]`とかで個別指定もできるようにしてくれればいいのに。","ts":"1636593091.321600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lf2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2108c53-714f-422b-b94f-ba37571d42b7","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"`\u003chttp://dataclasses.KW|dataclasses.KW\u003e_ONLY`ですね\n\u003chttps://docs.python.org/ja/3.10/library/dataclasses.html#dataclasses.KW_ONLY\u003e","ts":"1636593022.320600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fQtSL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b901beb1-d169-40e2-b04e-de7b406f98c1","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"この `KW_ONLY` はPython的にはどういう扱いになるんだろう。。？予約語。。ではないですよね？","ts":"1636592942.320300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Menc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e6694c4-5b76-4348-a12a-c00a0effbdf0","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://www.python.jp/news/wnpython310/other-updates.html#Dataclass%E3%81%AE%E3%82%AD%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%89%E5%B0%82%E7%94%A8%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%89\u003e\n\u0026gt; データ型が KW_ONLY の属性があると、以降の属性は全てキーワードでのみ指定できます。KW_ONLY を指定した属性は単なるしるしとなり、作成されません。\n```# KW_ONLY 以降の、field2とfield3はキーワードで指定しなければならない\n# 例: Data(1, field2='A', field3='B') \n@dataclass\nclass Data:\n    field1: int\n    _: KW_ONLY\n    field2: str\n    field32: str```\nんん。。 文脈によって意味が変わる。。","ts":"1636592367.319300","attachments":[{"fallback":"Python 3.10の新機能(その11） その他の変更 - python.jp","id":1,"title":"Python 3.10の新機能(その11） その他の変更 - python.jp","title_link":"https://www.python.jp/news/wnpython310/other-updates.html#Dataclass%E3%81%AE%E3%82%AD%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%89%E5%B0%82%E7%94%A8%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%89","text":"その他、Python 3.10 で更新された機能から、お気に入りの項目を簡単に紹介します。 オックスフォード大学問題¶さてみなさん、Pythonのインタープリタを起動して、次の式を実行してみてください。 In [2]: 0xfor-d*University Out[2]","thumb_url":"https://www.python.jp/static/pythonjp/images/logo_red_120.png","blocks":null,"ts":1633359600,"service_name":"python.jp","service_icon":"https://www.python.jp/static/pythonjp/images/favicon_32.png","thumb_width":120,"thumb_height":40,"from_url":"https://www.python.jp/news/wnpython310/other-updates.html#Dataclass%E3%81%AE%E3%82%AD%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%89%E5%B0%82%E7%94%A8%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%89","original_url":"https://www.python.jp/news/wnpython310/other-updates.html#Dataclass%E3%81%AE%E3%82%AD%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%89%E5%B0%82%E7%94%A8%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%89"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"nanido","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W9zH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25cad24b-7439-49b9-b207-698348e59166","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"私もないですね。r-wakalangのslackで質問に挙がって考えつきました","ts":"1636588660.318500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hoe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67c6e071-8aca-44e8-8f3f-928f5bc5ea1e","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"なるほど、と思ったけど\nよく考えたらk付きで渡されたことなかった","ts":"1636561728.318000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B9rz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"232b02da-28c6-46fa-b209-05463c880836","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"1.2kを1200に変換する多分最短の方法、PythonでもRと同じだった。\n`float('1.2k'.replace('k', 'e3'))`\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/Atsushi776/status/1458434215507525632\u003e","ts":"1636557513.316500","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/Atsushi776|@Atsushi776\u003e: Rで`1.2k`を数字に変換する最短ルートは\nas.integer(sub('k', 'e3', '1.2k'))\nやな。\n\nkをe3に変換するのは我ながら良い思い付きだ。","id":1,"author_name":"atusy","author_subname":"@Atsushi776","author_link":"https://twitter.com/Atsushi776/status/1458434215507525632","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/737129240/P7502_normal.jpg","text":"Rで`1.2k`を数字に変換する最短ルートは\nas.integer(sub('k', 'e3', '1.2k'))\nやな。\n\nkをe3に変換するのは我ながら良い思い付きだ。","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1636552788,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/Atsushi776/status/1458434215507525632","original_url":"https://twitter.com/Atsushi776/status/1458434215507525632"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":3,"users":["UD1FQV38V","U81LLJ340","U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QdHQ"}]}]
